{"format":"telly-addicts-eps","v":1,"show":"Beetlejuice","i":9701,"eps":[{"s":1,"e":1,"t":"Critter Sitters","a":"1989-09-09","l":30,"d":"It's Beetlejuice and Lydia's 1st-year anniversary and he has no money to get her a present. Her getting a baby-sitting job prompts him to do the same...only he doesn't quite get the idea behind the job and finds taking care of Neitherworld infants more than he can handle!","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/534/1336534.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":2,"t":"The Big Face Off","a":"1989-09-16","l":30,"d":"First, Beetlejuice and Lydia are contestants in the Netherworld game show \"The 24-Hour Gross-Off\".","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/539/1349919.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":3,"t":"Skeletons in the Closet","a":"1989-09-16","l":30,"d":"Beetlejuice's closet of skeleton ghosts finally bursts open and the skeletons escape, running around telling the truth on him.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/539/1349920.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":4,"t":"A Dandy Handy Man","a":"1989-09-23","l":30,"d":"Lydia is getting ready for the big photo show, but she can't decide which of her pictures is the best. Beetlejuice loves all of her work, and decides he wants to buy whichever photo she picks - but he doesn't have any money.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/552/1381833.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":5,"t":"Out of My Mind","a":"1989-09-23","l":30,"d":"BJ and Lydia have a fight after Beetlejuice gets her in trouble for pulling a prank on her parents involving Delia's world famous spaghetti. Lydia banishes the ghost to the Neitherworld. Beetlejuice foolishly makes the comment that he can't get Lydia out of his mind and accidentally teleports her there. Lydia meets up with BJ's wimpy Will Power and overbearing Prankenstein.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/552/1381834.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":6,"t":"Stage Fright","a":"1989-09-30","l":30,"d":"Lydia wants to play Juliet in her school show, but plots revenge after Claire sabotages her.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/554/1385476.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":7,"t":"Spooky Tree","a":"1989-09-23","l":30,"d":"Lydia's favorite tree, Spooky, is slated to be cut down. Beetlejuice brings Spooky to life, allowing the tree to run rampant through the town.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/554/1385477.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":8,"t":"Laugh of the Party","a":"1989-10-07","l":30,"d":"It's Halloween and Claire's throwing the biggest bash in Peaceful Pines until Lydia announces that she, too will throw a party. But when Delia's party ideas fall short, Beetlejuice introduces Peaceful Pines to \"Party People in a Can\".","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/570/1425277.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":9,"t":"Worm Welcome","a":"1989-10-14","l":30,"d":"Beetlejuice has a run-in with a newly-hatched Sandworm, and Lydia accidentally calls him out of the Neitherworld while he's in contact with it, so they both are brought to the Outerworld.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/585/1463788.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":10,"t":"Bad Neighbour Beetlejuice","a":"1989-10-21","l":30,"d":"Beetlejuice's neighbors kick him out, so he tries to be a \"good neighbor\". But his idea of being a good neighbor is very different indeed.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/598/1496361.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":11,"t":"Campfire Ghouls","a":"1989-10-21","l":30,"d":"Beetlejuice (disguised as Betty Juice), Lydia, Bertha and Prudence go camping in the Neitherwoods.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/598/1496360.jpg"},{"s":1,"e":12,"t":"Pest O' the West","a":"1989-10-28","l":30},{"s":1,"e":13,"t":"Bizarre Bazaar","a":"1989-11-04","l":30},{"s":1,"e":14,"t":"Pat on the Back","a":"1989-11-04","l":30},{"s":1,"e":15,"t":"Poopsie","a":"1989-11-11","l":30},{"s":1,"e":16,"t":"It'